assert extract_config({"s3_bucket": "b", "s3_region": "r", "sqs_url": "u"}, "s3_") == {"bucket": "b", "region": "r"}

Idiomatic reference:
def extract_config(settings, prefix):
    return {
        key[len(prefix):]: value
        for key, value in settings.items()
        if key.startswith(prefix)
    }

